            {"type":"text","id":"chatAssistantText1","name":"Assistant response","fill":"$panel-text","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":"fill_container","content":"I understand what you’re asking for, but I need to clarify my capabilities. I do not have access to the local filesystem or the PDFs in that directory.","lineHeight":1.45,"fontFamily":"$font","fontSize":12,"fontWeight":"normal"},
            {"type":"text","id":"chatAssistantGuidance1","name":"Assistant tool guidance","fill":"$panel-text","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":"fill_container","content":"What I can help with:\n\n1. Create a Python script that scans a folder of PDFs, extracts metadata, generates filenames from titles, and renames them safely.\n\n2. Create a PowerShell script for Windows that performs the same steps.\n\n3. Outline the review workflow before you run it locally.","lineHeight":1.45,"fontFamily":"$font","fontSize":11,"fontWeight":"normal"}
